{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_pianst_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_pianst_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"阳光洒落之前","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_pianst_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"587a22ef06f4ae6ef0801089e13768f87a54bee98ec35185fb326d3c03a7a85f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"格特鲁德邀请车尔尼，希望他能在某场葬礼上演奏刚发表不久的《晨暮》。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g1_gorgeousstreets"},{"type":"narration","text":"“还有力气吗？我们再绕着夕照区走一圈？”\n“......”\n“哈哈，终于承认体力不如我了？”\n“太阳快落山了，夜里的风......很冷。”\n“我知道，我都知道。”\n眼前的人虚弱地笑着，那张苍白的脸却被夕阳镀成金色。\n“可我就是要一直走到太阳落山，从清晨走到黄昏。”\n“我要把养育了我二十年，也圈禁了我二十年的这方天地的样子，深深烙在心里......”\n“在我还能唾弃它、讴歌它、憎恨它、眷恋它的时候。”\n“因为我知道，无论是我，还是我的音乐，都再也不可能走出这小小的夕照区了。”\n“答应我，别像我一样，别在这件事上输给我......好吗？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你眼圈红红的。刚经过夕照厅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"节哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢关心，斯特罗洛——抱歉，是格特鲁德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，本来也没几个人知道我这些小小的偏好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就连侍从们也不习惯对他们的领主以名相称。说到底，时间太短，我和这座城市、这座高塔相互都还谈不上熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话又说回来，我倒是给你添麻烦了。今天所有人都在忙，只好让你到高庭区来一趟......给，你的药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高塔的守卫没为难你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打算为难，不过在看到你的字条之后就嘟囔着“大逆不道”之类的话，退到一边去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，这座高塔跟我可不光是不熟悉，我和它还有的斗呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，《晨暮》的曲谱署着车尔尼的名字传出了维谢海姆，这不比一个两个感染者踏入高庭区大逆不道多了。别太在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（苦笑）在意？平民和感染者，我都不是第一天当......反而是像你这样的贵族实在是太少了。我得再次谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忙着谢我，我也不光是叫你来拿药这么简单，还想请你帮我个忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是我能办到的，你尽管说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你能在我哥哥的葬礼上为他演奏一曲《晨暮》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道这有点强人所难，不光是得把长笛和大提琴的二重奏改成钢琴独奏的问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，他和你素昧平生，唯一的关系只有领主与领民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他......怎么说呢，他不是我父亲那样的铁腕领主，他是个摇摆不定的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不客气地说，很软弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也因为软弱到几乎一无是处，相比父亲，他也无害得多，无论是对我，还是对他的领民——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特鲁德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用这么故意刻薄地形容他。我知道失去重要之人的感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚还去看了老师。她和你现在一样，一聊起自己的女儿就没什么好话，说她倔强，说她不听话，说她没福分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可说到最后，她总会泣不成声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脆弱就是脆弱，假装责备逝者也掩盖不了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也得直说，伯爵的葬礼想必会有很多贵族出席。你做事又总是一石二羽，我猜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，你的赞助人会邀请很多音乐评论家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的名声确实已经打响，但还不够......我直说吧，还差得远。我们必须抓住每一次能让你扬名的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是你哥哥的葬礼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这是一场私人悼念，我会很乐意奏响《晨暮》，但在那些趾高气扬的贵族，和眼高于顶的评论家面前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是那个需要被安慰的人，格特鲁德。他们不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你不喜欢这样。你对音乐永远是纯粹的，但我不是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得无关紧要的东西，钱、名望、人脉......我不能不管。艺术家可以做到绝对的纯粹，但赞助人不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特鲁德......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再想想吧，好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，吃饭啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔苏拉，我知道了，别这么大嗓门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你一直等着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，出什么事了？你心情才好起来没两天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特鲁德那边......来了一个请求，希望我在她兄长的葬礼上演奏《晨暮》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这有什么好犹豫的，她不是你的赞助人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那可是一位贵族的公开葬礼啊，乌尔苏拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我而言，演奏《晨暮》......就好像撕开自己的外壳，把最脆弱的那部分......展现给别人，期待他们的理解，期待他们的共鸣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如是为你、为格特鲁德，甚至为夕照区的随便哪位邻居奏响这首乐曲，我都心甘情愿。我知道你们会理解我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些贵族，那些评论家......他们能理解什么？技法的巧妙，还是像我看到过的一篇评价《晨暮》的奇文......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“作者卑微身份和音乐野心反差强烈到不成正比”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我为什么要在那些人面前把自己的脆弱公之于众？就为了名声？为了钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，先生，你先消消气，咱们先吃饭，好不好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"残党的活动报告、私人武装的集结点......唉，我的好哥哥啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯特罗洛女士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在做什么？那些——那些不是重要的机密文件吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以更应该去壁炉里待着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你，拉赫曼，“术师先生”把你派到维谢海姆来已经好几年了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，“术师先生”以前是我父亲的上线，后来是我哥哥的上线，现在则是我的。我并未打算改变这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感谢您的宽容，斯——不，格特鲁德女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下一步动作之前，我们还得把葬礼办好。你觉得还缺什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您明知故问了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能出席一位伯爵的葬礼，您邀请的评论家们都受宠若惊。但假如乐师本人不到场......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是个傻瓜，傻到对唾手可得的名利不屑一顾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也正因为他是个傻瓜，《晨暮》的作者才是想着范妮的他，而不是想着亲爱的哥哥的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如您真想把这种重情的人牢牢控制在自己掌心，或许您应该在私人关系上更进一步......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别出馊主意了，他对我没那个意思。让他觉得我是个慷慨的赞助人，是他好友中最值得依靠的那个，这就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这样一来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得万一他不来，我的努力就全白费了，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他会来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_488_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您留了后手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有什么后手，只是了解他罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者说，他只是太纯粹了，纯粹到稍微打打交道，就能一眼把他望到底。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么叫“在那之前你吃饭都是不等我的”，咱一向是等着先生吃饭的好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可还记着呢，有一次范妮找我，说是我把对位法习题做错了，我放下碗就冲了出去，在老师家和范妮一直吵到深夜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果饿着肚子回家时，桌子上干干净净，什么都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱也没想到那天她们正好揭不开锅。再说，咱还不是连夜做了饭给范妮家送过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......范妮还烫了舌头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还说人家，你自己不也差点把烤土豆掉到地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"土豆汤还温着，再来一碗吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁呀？门没锁，进来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎欢迎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔苏拉大姐，你们家现在可好找多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是先生争气嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，他可不光替自己争了口气！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝贺你们搬了新家，也祝贺车尔尼，以前还是个小鬼，转眼间就成了大人物，办了件我们想都不敢想的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，这房间真敞亮......这是什么，浴缸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可好多年没见过这东西啦。大姐，这东西用起来怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还用问？以前一到阴雨天，我就觉得骨头缝里发痒，难受得不行。多亏了先生，现在到浴缸里泡一泡，整个人就好多啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞧瞧，车尔尼，乌尔苏拉大姐的日子好起来啦，这可都是你的功劳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你！这可是高庭区的老爷都喜欢的好酒，为了从那个开咖啡店的家伙那里搞到手，我可花了一番心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可太客气啦。我们正好吃饭，留下来一起吃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前天突然来了一帮人，说是来“探寻大作曲家车尔尼出身地”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小吃摊主","speakerId":"avg_npc_494_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧我一边拉手风琴一边吆喝，油煎酸渍卷心菜摊子可算开张了一回。万一以后还有这样的生意，我可不能放过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，你快去忙吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，刚刚怎么啦，别人来祝贺你，连个招呼也不打一声？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我前一阵子给人家添了不小的麻烦，所以就......稍微有点尴尬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"添麻烦？哦，你说吵架那事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早都过去啦。你去跟他道了歉，他也说了，你是关心则乱，他根本没放在心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生你不怎么会说话，夕照区哪个人不知道这件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过咱也得说，你确实太急躁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"范妮小姐吃东西尝不出味道，她病得糊涂了，才以为是别人嫌弃自己，可你怎么也跟着一点就着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑到小吃摊的时候咱都吓着啦，头一次见你发那么大的火——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是咱不好了。先吃饭，先吃饭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔苏拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，怎么啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，我要是去了那场葬礼，像大叔刚刚说的那种生意......会多起来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如我把自己的脆弱撕开，给那些丝毫不关心我们命运的人看，让他们品头论足，夕照区......就能多几间带浴缸的房子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对。音乐不该是这样的，至少我的音乐不该是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"narration","text":"“因为我知道，无论是我，还是我的音乐，都再也不可能走出这小小的夕照区了。”\n“答应我，别像我一样，别在这件事上输给我......好吗？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去找格特鲁德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早一点答应她的邀请，我也能早一点开始把《晨暮》改成钢琴独奏曲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"narration","text":"时间过得飞快。\n上一任斯特罗洛伯爵的葬礼已经进行了一半，演奏即将开始。\n车尔尼抬头望向远方，看见的是高庭区高耸的建筑，但他想起的是那个陪着范妮一遍又一遍地路过夕照厅的下午。\n他向人群浅浅鞠了一躬，坐下，开始演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"居然让一个感染者在葬礼上奏乐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怕不是借着哥哥死了的机会，想多卖几张唱片呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g7_concerthall_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饶舌的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"钢琴独奏？我很怀疑他能否用一架钢琴就将长笛与大提琴的气质同时表现出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"音乐家的耳朵很灵敏。他听见了所有那些他尚未真正开始演奏，就已充斥着恶意的声音。\n他懊悔地咬住舌头，但演奏已经开始了。\n他已经听见了一切，但他必须让自己什么都听不见。\n旋律在广场上缓缓流淌，那些嘈杂并未平息，却也在同时渐渐离他而去。\n晨暮。\n清晨与黄昏。\n如果说长笛清澈、明亮、宽广，如同山顶一览无余的日出，那么，钢琴演奏的朝阳，从一开始就被一层薄雾笼罩着。\n阳光一视同仁地洒向大地，不因干渴而收敛片刻，也不因云翳而强烈分毫。\n清晨的丝丝寒意，甚至让人从中感受到某种无情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......很大胆的处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饶舌的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还是觉得不大对。这真的能叫朝阳吗？这样的朝阳，究竟能照亮什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或许什么都不能照亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他还挺投入的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在这么多贵族面前演奏，他这辈子大概也就这一次了，不抓紧机会怎么行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过要我说，斯特罗洛——不是人群里进进出出那位，是棺材里躺着的那个，他也真是倒霉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在父亲的阴影里活了那么多年，刚上台掌权没多久，就因为一场急病去世了，葬礼上奏乐的还是个感染者。"},{"type":"narration","text":"清晨与黄昏。\n即使在低音区盘桓再久，击锤也不可能像琴弓那样，用残阳血般沉郁的猩红震动听者的心弦。\n因此，他选择演奏一个看似再寻常不过的夕照。\n太阳要落下去了，我们该睡了。\n短促的呼吸声，床铺的气味，天花板上的橘红，深蓝色天幕中隐现的碎星。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g13_afterglow_R2"},{"type":"narration","text":"彻底转黑的夜将逝者紧紧拥抱，苟延残喘的光亮仍不肯就此离去，而音乐家将这一切弃之不顾，演奏明暗交接处那一抹颤抖的青绿。\n激烈而平静、深刻而无谓，再寻常不过的生离死别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斯特罗洛伯爵，真的是......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畏畏缩缩的家伙，说一句话要赔好几个笑，就算继承了爵位之后也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我最后一次见他的时候，他备错了礼品，我把他好好嘲笑了一番......可现在，就好像他还在我眼前笑似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不该那么做，真的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嘘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吸鼻子）"},{"type":"narration","text":"清晨与黄昏。\n旭日一路爬升，直到最高的那个点，高到令人几乎不敢呼吸，然后缓缓下落，直到夕阳沉沉，没入大地。\n和太阳相比，我们还太渺小，还太脆弱，我们的喜怒哀乐弥足珍贵，却又微不足道。\n假如我们能在尘世驻留得长些，再长些，是否就能看见疼痛被消解，皱纹被抚平，失去的爱在东升的夕阳和西沉的朝日间变得年轻？\n但我们只是囿于时间的渺小生物，我们终将离别。\n一场娓娓道来的离别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g8_concerthall_outside_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"在场的所有人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"最后一个音符消失在黄昏的风里。\n直到风将音符吹出维谢海姆，吹向看不见的远方，窃窃私语声才重新响了起来。\n相比音乐开始前，这些私语显得严肃而收敛，其间夹杂着低回的啜泣声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道我想起谁了吗？我想起我叔叔了。战场上退下来的老兵，脾气很坏，和我也没太多交集，后来人也糊涂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他去世前有一次，我去拜访他，正巧撞见他在花园里烧东西。纸灰被风卷起，好像一场从地面下到天上的灰色的雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼，车尔尼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尖酸的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人的命运真的毫无公平可言，他怎么会出生在这个地方，怎么偏偏会是个感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不说话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饶舌的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吸鼻子）我......唉......我还能说什么？我还配说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饶舌的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等我回去，等我平静下来，我会写一篇温和的批评。你知道，那是我最高的赞赏。但现在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饶舌的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饶舌的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说点别的，你看见埃德先生了吗？他是斯特罗洛女士这次请来的最德高望重的评论家，可我一直没看见他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斯特罗洛女士刚才就在葬礼现场找他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饶舌的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刚才？车尔尼先生奏乐的时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"narration","text":"车尔尼缓缓吐出一口郁结已久的气。\n他的耳朵很灵敏。他听见了一切，那些被成见所困，同时也被艺术......被自己的脆弱打动的声音。\n他抹了一把脸上的泪水，无意间瞟到了格特鲁德的身影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃德先生，您在夕照区的小巷子里迷了路，没出事真是万幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德高望重的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"劳您大驾把我从那里带出来，甚至让您错过了车尔尼先生的演奏，我有责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧您说的。即使在那里，我们不也听见了吗？多美的音乐啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"格特鲁德在转过头之前忘了隐去脸上公式化的微笑，忘了换上满脸的哀戚，就那么和车尔尼视线相接。\n当她发觉音乐家通红的眼眶与自己的表情多不相称时，她才意识到，自己犯了个大错误。\n但愿挽回还来得及，她这么想着，维持着脸上的笑容，抛下身边的评论家，快步走上前去。\n正如她所料，车尔尼也朝自己迎面走来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饶舌的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼怎么回事，他没向观众致意，反而直接朝斯特罗洛女士走去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饶舌的评论家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......也对，他们一定有很多话要说吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g13_afterglow_L2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是......你对你哥哥的追悼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......艺术家可以做到绝对的纯粹，但赞助人不行。"},{"type":"narration","text":"夕阳西斜，两人都刻意没再去看对方的脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那好，现在轮到你悼念他了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"车尔尼快步离开夕照区的广场，没有致意，没有停留，没有看任何人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你的信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁寄来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......斯特罗洛伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们已经一个月没再联系了，会不会......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邀请函......和亲笔信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还想邀请我第二次吗，格特鲁德......斯特罗洛女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，先看看她写了什么吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寒暄，问候......无聊透顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，她在结尾说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我不会为了那场葬礼道歉，也不为我从未哀悼自己的哥哥道歉。我为欺骗你而道歉。”\n“你敢相信吗，事后，我发现自己只办成了一件事。”\n“让一位感染者在斯特罗洛伯爵的葬礼上演奏一曲，给我亲爱的斯特罗洛家族送上了......‘最诚挚的祝福’。真可笑，不是吗？”\n“......我居然又随手写下了这么冒犯的话。”\n“看来我们终究是不一样的。”\n“抱歉。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特鲁德，你这个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邀请函......也不是她自己的，而是......巡演？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巡演？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那场葬礼之后，许多评论家和贵族想让我去他们的城市演出，于是她干脆策划了一个“巡演”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“艺术家可以做到绝对的纯粹，但赞助人不行”，是这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔苏拉，关于巡演，你怎么想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者的巡演......咱想象不到是什么样的，但肯定不轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何止是不轻松。大概就和珍奇动物展览差不多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我必须去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是相信自己的琴声，感染者的琴声......能够跨越最遥远的隔阂，走入那些贵族的心中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算没有报酬，就算像个珍奇动物一样被那些人围观，只要兽笼中还有一架钢琴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算只有一根铁棍，能让我敲响铁笼，我就心甘情愿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"narration","text":"如同车尔尼所料，感染者音乐家的巡演就如同珍奇动物展览一样。\n就像现在，在巡演的最后一站......\n为了让他这个感染者能用自己的双脚走向演奏会场，街道被清空，没人愿意和感染者走在一起，除了一个不耐烦的看守。\n忽然，他听见几丝极细、极熟悉的乐音，从路旁的花园中传来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《晨暮》？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别停下，赶紧走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，那边的花园......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是侯爵大人的家族墓地！快走快走！"},{"type":"narration","text":"车尔尼迈开脚步，同时仰头看向天空。\n城市阴翳的天空几乎不辨明暗，巡演以来极不规律的作息也让他昼夜颠倒，随时都想沉沉睡去。\n他已经快没力气了。\n但他还要支着这具染病的身躯，再绕着这方名为生活的巨大的天地，一圈又一圈地走下去。\n他将唾弃，将讴歌，将憎恨，将眷恋......\n从清晨，直到黄昏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
